A python wrapper around the [Agent](https://www.ispyconnect.com/download.aspx) API. 

Create package:

\agent-py>python3 setup.py sdist bdist_wheel

install locally:

\agent-py\dist>pip install agent-py-0.0.1.tar.gz

uninstall locally:

pip uninstall agent-py
